WEBVTT

00:00:00.117 --> 00:00:05.781
This video shows how an administrator records a staff performance appraisal on a phone.

00:00:07.443 --> 00:00:20.307
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR and Staff, and choose Performance. The totals are at the top. The list is empty for now, because no appraisal has been written yet.

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:33.898
Tap New Appraisal. A form opens.

00:00:47.536 --> 00:00:50.824
Tap Select staff and choose Ali Khan.

00:00:58.476 --> 00:01:04.332
Set Period Start and Period End. These are the dates the review covers.

00:01:20.308 --> 00:01:25.684
Tap the fourth star. The label beside Rating changes to Good.

00:01:32.435 --> 00:01:39.467
Write the strengths and the goals for the next period. Areas for Improvement and Comments are optional.

00:01:57.132 --> 00:02:05.652
Scroll down and tap Create. The form closes and the list shows a card for Ali Khan with the period and the four stars.

00:02:17.366 --> 00:02:23.486
The appraisal is saved. Tap View on the card any time to read the full review.
